  <AltText>
    Artfight attack of Chachamaru that we got from froglucose. Chachamaru has slightly tanned skin, eyes that are dark pink for the top half and dark green for the bottom half, hair that is a gradient from dark green to dark pink, and two large, imposing green-yellow horns. Poking out from dragons mouth are two prominent pearly-white well-brushed fangs. She is wearing a light purple dress and rainbow arm warmers. The background is decorated with a repeating heart pattern, with the colours alternating through the colours of the pride flag.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    Revenge attack!! In exchange for the Minnie drawing, I offer a drawing of Chachamaru! Hope you enjoy :]
